  "details": "When a player in a 3.0 avatar plays their fall animation, any pickups they are holding lock in place and are completely frozen until the player stops falling. In worlds that rely on movement in 3D space, it makes it almost impossible to move downwards.\nReproduce:\nAttempt to move or use pickups while fall animation plays in a 3.0 avatar.",
